		"description": "Azkaal was once Lord Kragh's champion, the Prince of Destruction, and the mightiest of the demons who invaded Ashan. In ancient times he led a mighty horde out of the depths of Sheogh, slaughtered thousands of angels and took more than half of the sky cities. But for the last eight centuries he has been trapped, like an insect caught in amber. The mighty archangels Sarah and Michael joined forces to seal his soul in an indestructible artifact, at the very moment when Azkaal was about to win total victory. Naturally, he is not pleased. Worse, although he has recently awakened, he finds that his freedom is a freedom in name only: his soul now dwells in the body of a wretched human. Burning with rage, Azkaal will not rest until all his enemies are destroyed and Ashan is utterly ruined.",
