	"h6BossDaughterOfMalassa": {
		"name": {
			"singular": "Daughter of Malassa",
			"plural": "Daughters of Malassa"
		},
		"description": "\"An avatar of Malassa is one thing; at least they spread destruction only by night. But a Daughter of Malassa is another matter. She is a mad Dragon Knight, a shadow of nightmare, a cursed soul.\" These words from the journal of Johann, a Falcon priest, sum up the little the Holy Empire knows about Dragon Knights and their dragon forms. The mages of the Seven Cities first coined the name Dragon Knight for those who have found the dragon within and sworn to protect Ashan. They may serve Malassa, Elrath or any of the Elemental Dragons. Powerful Dragon Knights master the ability to take the form of an avatar of the dragon they worship. Though their dragon form is smaller than a true dragon, it keeps most of the Dragon Knight's skills, which makes them deadly foes.",
